    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "Ah, I was expecting that negatives indices would be always out-of-bounds and that out-of-bounds indices would not be counted against `indices_are_sorted` and `unique_indices`. It seems the way to do this, then, would be to use `jnp.arange(a.size) + a.size` as out of bounds indices, then set `indices_are_sorted=False unique_indices=True`?",
